          </infoLinks>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Jolly Gutpipes" id="2609-4eb4-2551-7032" hidden="false">
              <description>At the start of each close combat phase the Sloppity Bilepiper can play one of the tunes, chosen from the &quot;Jolly Gutpipes&quot; Table, which affects the unit they are with. The effect of that tune lasts until the end of that phase. A unit can only benefit from one tune once per phase.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </infoGroup>
      </infoGroups>
