              <rules>
                <rule name="Shadow Form" id="4990-f2b2-9d46-2c4c" hidden="false">
                  <description>Be&apos;lakor has a 6+ Ward save, and any missile attacks targeting him suffer -2 To Hit.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Lord of Torment" id="5dca-a6c6-3a50-adf7" hidden="false">
                  <description>If one or more enemy units failed a Panic or Break test during the previous turn (after any re-rolls for special rules such as a Battle Standard Bearer&apos;s Hold Your Ground! rule), Be&apos;lakor receives D3 additional power dice in the Magic phase, which only he can make use of. Any unused power dice are discarded at the end of the Magic phase as normal.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="The Dark Master" id="3c21-7b4a-1bf3-b9e0" hidden="false">
                  <description>All enemy units within 12&quot; of Be&apos;lakor suffer -1 to their Leadership.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
