              <rules>
                <rule name="The Hellforged Host" id="6f9f-ab9d-af1a-7859" hidden="false">
                  <description>If Skarbrand is included in your army, you may upgrade one unit of Bloodletters to the Hellforged Host for a cost of +1 point per model. This unit has the Armour Piercing (1) special rule and may re-roll To Wound rolls of 1.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Rage Embodied" id="e4b4-6685-0753-77d2" hidden="false">
                  <description>Skarbrand can never lose his Frenzy. In addition, while Skarbrand is alive, all units within 12&quot; (friendly and enemy) of him are subject to the rules for Hatred.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
