                        <profile name="Staff of Tomorrow" id="7dd0-82fb-984b-22f2" hidden="false" typeId="24d7-7f7d-a4d7-c26c" typeName="Arcane Item">
                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="3df8-4ab0-c4bd-e2ad">Kairos allows you to re-roll a single D6 of your choice once per turn – declare before you make the re-roll. If this is used to re-roll a single dice from a batch of 2D6, 3D6 etc, the other dice in that batch cannot be re-rolled.</characteristic>
