                  </infoLinks>
                  <rules>
                    <rule name="The Eternal Dance" id="799f-0d34-5da3-d73b" hidden="false">
                      <description>At the start of each of the controlling player&apos;s Close Combat phases, the Masque must choose one dance to perform from the Eternal Dances. These abilities target one enemy unit (which may be in combat). Each dance has a range of 12&quot; and does not require line of sight. Until the end of the phase, the target suffers a penalty to the characteristic stated (to a minimum of 1).</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </infoGroup>
              </infoGroups>
