            <rule name="Exalted Fire of Tzeentch" id="f336-4e45-2c78-c8db" hidden="false">
              <description>During the Shooting phase, the Exalted Flamer can shoot either Pink Fire or Blue Fire below. If a misfire is rolled when resolving Pink Fire or Blue Fire, the Exalted Flamer suffers D6 Strength D6 hits with the Flaming Attacks special rule.</description>
