                <profile name="Pestilent Mucus" id="d755-4ead-a4b5-4c7f" hidden="false" typeId="3e3c-de8a-94f0-179a" typeName="Daemonic Gift">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="32f8-c3d9-bf18-d3c1">When this Daemon suffers a wound, all enemy models in base contact must pass a Toughness test for each Wound inflicted on the Daemon or themselves suffer a Wound with the Ignores Armour Saves special rule. This has no effect on Daemons of Nurgle.</characteristic>
