                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="32f8-c3d9-bf18-d3c1">At the start of each close combat phase, all enemy units in base contact with the Daemon suffer D6 Hits. Models Hit must pass a Toughness test or suffer a Wound which Ignores Armour saves. This has no effect on Daemons of Nurgle.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
