                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="de63-d6da-efa8-00ac">Any model that suffers one or more unsaved Wounds from the Staff of Change must immediately pass a Toughness test or suffer an additional D6 Wounds with the Ignores Armour Saves special rule. If a multiple-wound model loses its last Wound to the Staff of Change, all enemy models within D6&quot; immediately suffer a single Strength 5 hit.</characteristic>
