                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="9d2e-d14d-dd58-a829">The Flesh Peeler may be used at the start of your shooting phase as long as the wearer is not in close combat. When used, all enemy units within 12&quot; take D6 Hits. Each Hit automatically Wounds on a 5+ which Ignores Armour saves.</characteristic>
